@startuml P-平台级能力
' 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 L3 · P 平台级能力（UC-SUB-P-01 ~ P-06）
title 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 · P 平台级能力
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "平台运营方" as OPER
actor "监管人员" as REGU

rectangle "P 平台级能力" {
  usecase "UC-SUB-P-01 公示平台费率与抽成" as P01
  usecase "UC-SUB-P-02 存证并出证平台证据" as P02
  usecase "UC-SUB-P-03 划定试点范围并扩展行业" as P03
  usecase "UC-SUB-P-04 替代政务对接并双轨切换" as P04
  usecase "UC-SUB-P-05 承诺平台定位与信任背书" as P05
  usecase "UC-SUB-P-06 导入存量商户并冷启动" as P06
}

OPER --> P01
OPER --> P02
OPER --> P03
OPER --> P04
OPER --> P05
OPER --> P06
REGU --> P02

note bottom of P02
  监管端调取存证出证（31 §2.6「存证出证 P-02」）
end note
@enduml
